es will turn out for the best.<br><br>Episodes can be played in any order, as they each encapsulate fantasies on their own.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The milfs</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520110/extras/milfs.png?t=1745680754\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The girls your age</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520110/extras/teens.png?t=1745680754\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The enemies</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520110/extras/enemies.png?t=1745680754\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520110/extras/fetishez.png?t=1745680754\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>netori: the protagonist (MC) takes away someone else's love interest<br>]*]corruption<br></li><li>anal sex<br></li><li>harem<br></li><li>pregnancy<br></li><li>sex in front of others<br></li><li>cheating</li></ul><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520110/extras/faq.png?t=1745680754\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Q:</strong>Why episodes? <strong>A:</strong> It wasn't meant to be that long and my art style / animation evolved through years.<br></li><li><strong>Q:</strong>Will Ep. 1 &amp; 2 get revamped with the new style? <strong>A:</strong> Yes, they will be updated to match the style of Ep. 3. And more content will be added to those.<br></li><li><strong>Q:</strong>Is Ep. 3 longer than 1 &amp; 2? <strong>A:</strong> Yes, way longer. I took notice of your complaints and I will deliver all the story inside Ep. 3.<br></li><li><strong>Q:</strong>Any new mechanics? <strong>A:</strong> Yes, I'm currently developing a technique to make the animated scenes more interactive and easier to switch between.<br></li><li><strong>Q:</strong>Any news in terms of animations? <strong>A:</strong> Ye